Excellent patch. I'd like to suggest a small counter-patch from a very
very old YANI: If adding water to an elemental increases its HP,
logically removing water from it should deplete the elemental.
Therefore I suggest that attacking a water elemental with a wielded
towel should absorb some of its water and weaken it- either significant
HP loss or level drain.

This has the happy side effect of making towels that little bit more
useful: According to THHGTG, a towel is the most useful thing you could
possibly own. Given that HHG is the reason towels are included in the
game, I think they should have far more little uses like this. There a
thread on it here:
http://groups.google.com/group/rec.games.roguelike.nethack/browse_frm/thread/8f3ec618f39f231d/936505708ad0617b?lnk=st&q=nethack+towels+useful&rnum=1#936505708ad0617b

